{
    "title": "Western Union Send Money Now",
    "description": "Enjoy a $0 transfer fee* on your first transfer with Western Union\u00ae. <b>Send money</b> fast to Mexico and globally from the US, available 24/7.   \r\n   \r\n<b>Send money</b>, track <b>money transfers</b>, <b>pay bills</b>, review <b>exchange rates</b> and find agent locations- all on the go with the Western Union \u00ae <b>money transfer app</b>.   \r\n   \r\nWE MOVE MONEY TO MORE THAN 200 COUNTRIES AND TERRITORIES  \r\nYour friends and loved ones can receive the funds directly to their bank account or mobile wallet** or pick up cash in their own currency at a convenient location near them.  \r\n   \r\nSIMPLE CARD SCANNING  \r\nQuickly make a money transfer by setting up card payments on your mobile phone. Avoid mistakes by scanning your credit*** or debit card using the camera on your device.  \r\n   \r\nEASILY VIEW EXCHANGE RATES  \r\nView the latest international exchange rates instantly using the widget on our mobile money transfer app. See how the US dollar compares to other currencies on the move.  \r\n   \r\nQUICKLY REPEAT TRANSFERS  \r\nSave your receiver\u2019s details to your resend list and make repeat international money transfers fast through the app.  \r\n   \r\nPAY BILLS ON THE GO  \r\nFrom your car payment to a mortgage, pay bills anytime, anywhere, with our money transfer app.  \r\n   \r\nSTART ON THE MONEY TRANSFER APP, PAY IN CASH  \r\nSave time at the counter by starting your money transfer on our app and paying in cash at a participating agent location. Visit one of more than 61,000**** across the US.  \r\n   \r\nPAY THE WAY THAT WORKS FOR YOU  \r\nPay directly from your bank account, cash at an agent location, or with a credit***/debit card.  \r\n   \r\nEASY TO SEND, SIMPLE TO RECEIVE  \r\nUse the Western Union\u00ae app to send money and choose how your receiver will get the funds.  \r\n   \r\nBank account  \r\n\u2022 Send money from your bank to billions of accounts worldwide.  \r\nCash pickup  \r\n\u2022 Transfer money with the app to thousands of cash pickup locations internationally.  \r\nMobile wallet  \r\n\u2022 You can send money directly to your recipient\u2019s mobile wallet** from one of our partners (in select countries).  \r\n   \r\nFEES AND IMPORTANT DISCLOSURES   \r\nWestern Union makes money from both transfer fees and currency exchange. When choosing a money transmitter, carefully compare the transfer fees and exchange rates. Fees, foreign exchange rates, and taxes may vary by brand, channel, and location based on a number of factors. Fees and rates are subject to change without notice. Please use care when providing commissary or bank account information. Funds will be paid into the account corresponding to your account number.   \r\n   \r\nServices may be provided by Western Union Financial Services, Inc. NMLS# 906983 and/or Western Union International Services, LLC NMLS# 906985. See terms and conditions for details.   \r\n   \r\nWestern Union has offices worldwide and is headquartered in Denver, 7001 E. Belleview, Denver, CO 80237.   \r\n   \r\nDo you have questions about our services? Contact one of our nearby Western Union agent locations. Use our agent location finder to find one nearby or call +1-720-332-1000.   \r\n   \r\n* Currency exchange commission applicable. Not available for credit cards and transfers to Cuba.   \r\n** Money transfer to digital wallets is available for some international locations.   \r\n*** A card-issuer cash advance fee and associated interest charges may apply if you use a credit card. To avoid these fees or for reduced fees, use a debit card or check other payment methods.   \r\n**** Network data as of September 30, 2021.  \r\n \r\nAdditional third-party charges may apply.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Enjoy a $0 transfer fee* on your first transfer with Western Union\u00ae. <b>Send money</b> fast to Mexico and globally from the US, available 24/7.   <br>   <br><b>Send money</b>, track <b>money transfers</b>, <b>pay bills</b>, review <b>exchange rates</b> and find agent locations- all on the go with the Western Union \u00ae <b>money transfer app</b>.   <br>   <br>WE MOVE MONEY TO MORE THAN 200 COUNTRIES AND TERRITORIES  <br>Your friends and loved ones can receive the funds directly to their bank account or mobile wallet** or pick up cash in their own currency at a convenient location near them.  <br>   <br>SIMPLE CARD SCANNING  <br>Quickly make a money transfer by setting up card payments on your mobile phone. Avoid mistakes by scanning your credit*** or debit card using the camera on your device.  <br>   <br>EASILY VIEW EXCHANGE RATES  <br>View the latest international exchange rates instantly using the widget on our mobile money transfer app. See how the US dollar compares to other currencies on the move.  <br>   <br>QUICKLY REPEAT TRANSFERS  <br>Save your receiver\u2019s details to your resend list and make repeat international money transfers fast through the app.  <br>   <br>PAY BILLS ON THE GO  <br>From your car payment to a mortgage, pay bills anytime, anywhere, with our money transfer app.  <br>   <br>START ON THE MONEY TRANSFER APP, PAY IN CASH  <br>Save time at the counter by starting your money transfer on our app and paying in cash at a participating agent location. Visit one of more than 61,000**** across the US.  <br>   <br>PAY THE WAY THAT WORKS FOR YOU  <br>Pay directly from your bank account, cash at an agent location, or with a credit***/debit card.  <br>   <br>EASY TO SEND, SIMPLE TO RECEIVE  <br>Use the Western Union\u00ae app to send money and choose how your receiver will get the funds.  <br>   <br>Bank account  <br>\u2022 Send money from your bank to billions of accounts worldwide.  <br>Cash pickup  <br>\u2022 Transfer money with the app to thousands of cash pickup locations internationally.  <br>Mobile wallet  <br>\u2022 You can send money directly to your recipient\u2019s mobile wallet** from one of our partners (in select countries).  <br>   <br>FEES AND IMPORTANT DISCLOSURES   <br>Western Union makes money from both transfer fees and currency exchange. When choosing a money transmitter, carefully compare the transfer fees and exchange rates. Fees, foreign exchange rates, and taxes may vary by brand, channel, and location based on a number of factors. Fees and rates are subject to change without notice. Please use care when providing commissary or bank account information. Funds will be paid into the account corresponding to your account number.   <br>   <br>Services may be provided by Western Union Financial Services, Inc. NMLS# 906983 and/or Western Union International Services, LLC NMLS# 906985. See terms and conditions for details.   <br>   <br>Western Union has offices worldwide and is headquartered in Denver, 7001 E. Belleview, Denver, CO 80237.   <br>   <br>Do you have questions about our services? Contact one of our nearby Western Union agent locations. Use our agent location finder to find one nearby or call +1-720-332-1000.   <br>   <br>* Currency exchange commission applicable. Not available for credit cards and transfers to Cuba.   <br>** Money transfer to digital wallets is available for some international locations.   <br>*** A card-issuer cash advance fee and associated interest charges may apply if you use a credit card. To avoid these fees or for reduced fees, use a debit card or check other payment methods.   <br>**** Network data as of September 30, 2021.  <br> <br>Additional third-party charges may apply.",
